   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 🗺️ 从零开始：计算机如何"画"出流域？\n",
    "> 面向大一新生的 MERIT-Basins 算法原理解析\n",
    "\n",
    "欢迎来到水文地理信息系统（GIS）的世界！本教程将带你理解 `merit-catchment-extract` 工具背后的核心逻辑。我们将不只运行代码，而是去理解代码背后的**数学**和**地理**原理。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🎯 我们要解决什么问题？\n",
    "\n",
    "当我们知道河流上某一点（比如一个水文站）的坐标时，我们想知道：\n",
    "\n",
    "**地表上哪些区域的雨水最终会流到这个点？**\n",
    "\n",
    "这个区域就是**流域 (Watershed/Catchment)**。\n",
    "\n",
    "![流域示意图](https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Drainage_basin_en.svg/400px-Drainage_basin_en.svg.png)\n",
    "\n",
    "*图片来源: Wikipedia - 流域示意图*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🛠️ 准备工作\n",
    "\n",
    "首先，导入我们的工具箱。如果遇到 `ModuleNotFoundError`，请先安装：\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "pip install -e .\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 基础库\n",
    "import geopandas as gpd\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "from shapely.geometry import Point, Polygon\n",
    "from collections import defaultdict, deque\n",
    "\n",
    "# 导入我们封装好的核心模块\n",
    "from merit_extractor.topology import build_upstream_graph, bfs_upstream\n",
    "from merit_extractor.gis_utils import merge_catchments_fixed_robust\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✓ 所有模块导入成功！\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 第一步：河流在计算机眼中是什么？(图论基础)\n",
    "\n",
    "在地图上，河流是弯弯曲曲的线。但在计算机算法中，河流是一个**有向图 (Directed Graph)**。\n",
    "\n",
    "- **节点 (Node)**: 每一段河流（河段）\n",
    "- **边 (Edge)**: 水流的方向（从上游流向下游）\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1.1 什么是图？\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "     101      102\n",
    "      \\       /\n",
    "       ↘     ↙\n",
    "         103\n",
    "          ↓\n",
    "         105 → 出口（大海）\n",
    "        /\n",
    "      ↗\n",
    "    104\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "上图表示：\n",
    "- 河段 101 和 102 汇入河段 103\n",
    "- 河段 103 和 104 汇入河段 105\n",
    "- 河段 105 是出口，流入大海"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 1.2 用代码构建河网拓扑图\n",
    "\n",
    "让我们看看代码库中的 `topology.py` 是如何工作的："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 模拟一个微型河网数据\n",
    "# COMID: 河段的身份证号\n",
    "# NextDownID: 水流向哪里（下游是谁）\n",
    "mock_river_data = {\n",
    "    'COMID':      [101, 102, 103, 104, 105],\n",
    "    'NextDownID': [103, 103, 105, 105, 0]    # 0 代表入海口（没有下游）\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "# 创建一个简单的 GeoDataFrame（不需要真实的几何数据）\n",
    "df_riv = gpd.GeoDataFrame(mock_river_data)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"河网数据表：\")\n",
    "print(df_riv)\n",
    "print()\n",
    "\n",
    "# 调用工具库构建\"反向图\"（因为我们要往上游找！）\n",
    "G = build_upstream_graph(df_riv)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"计算机构建的'上游关系图' G:\")\n",
    "for downstream, upstreams in sorted(G.items()):\n",
    "    if upstreams:  # 只显示有上游的河段\n",
    "        print(f\"  河段 {downstream} 的上游是: {upstreams}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 💡 原理解析\n",
    "\n",
    "`build_upstream_graph` 函数将表格变成了**邻接表 (Adjacency List)**：\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "G[103] = {101, 102}  # 河段 103 的上游是 101 和 102\n",
    "G[105] = {103, 104}  # 河段 105 的上游是 103 和 104\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "这就像家谱一样，我们通过这种关系去"寻根"！\n",
    "\n",
    "**为什么用 Set 而不用 List？**\n",
    "- Set 自动去重\n",
    "- Set 查找时间是 O(1)，非常快"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 第二步：大海捞针 —— 捕捉河段 (空间索引)\n",
    "\n",
    "用户给的经纬度坐标往往不在河流线上（可能在岸边）。我们需要找到离这个点**最近**的那条河。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 2.1 暴力搜索 vs 空间索引\n",
    "\n",
    "**暴力方法**：遍历所有河段，计算距离，找最近的\n",
    "- 时间复杂度：O(n)，n 可能是几百万！\n",
    "\n",
    "**空间索引 (R-Tree)**：把空间划分成小格子，只搜索附近的格子\n",
    "- 时间复杂度：O(log n)\n",
    "\n",
    "代码库中的 `pick_nearest_reach` 函数就是用 R-Tree 来快速定位附近的河段。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 演示空间索引的概念\n",
    "from shapely.geometry import LineString\n",
    "\n",
    "# 创建一些模拟的河段几何\n",
    "rivers = [\n",
    "    LineString([(0, 0), (1, 1)]),\n",
    "    LineString([(2, 0), (2, 2)]),\n",
    "    LineString([(3, 3), (4, 4)]),\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "# 用户站点位置\n",
    "user_point = Point(0.5, 0.5)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 可视化\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(8, 6))\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, river in enumerate(rivers):\n",
    "    x, y = river.xy\n",
    "    ax.plot(x, y, 'b-', linewidth=2, label=f'河段 {i+1}' if i == 0 else \"\")\n",
    "\n",
    "ax.plot(user_point.x, user_point.y, 'r*', markersize=20, label='用户站点')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 找最近的河段\n",
    "distances = [river.distance(user_point) for river in rivers]\n",
    "nearest_idx = distances.index(min(distances))\n",
    "nearest_river = rivers[nearest_idx]\n",
    "x, y = nearest_river.xy\n",
    "ax.plot(x, y, 'g-', linewidth=4, label='最近的河段')\n",
    "\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel('经度', fontsize=12)\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel('纬度', fontsize=12)\n",
    "ax.set_title('河段捕捉示意图', fontsize=14)\n",
    "ax.legend()\n",
    "ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"用户站点到各河段的距离: {[f'{d:.3f}' for d in distances]}\")\n",
    "print(f\"最近的是河段 {nearest_idx + 1}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 第三步：顺藤摸瓜 —— 广度优先搜索 (BFS)\n",
    "\n",
    "现在我们要找到所有的上游。代码库使用了 **BFS (Breadth-First Search)** 算法。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 3.1 BFS 的工作原理\n",
    "\n",
    "想象一下病毒传播：从出口（患者0）开始，传染给它的直接上游，上游再传染给上游...\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "第0层: 出口 105\n",
    "       ↑\n",
    "第1层: 103, 104\n",
    "       ↑\n",
    "第2层: 101, 102 (103的上游)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "BFS 是一层一层往上找的！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 使用我们之前构建的图 G\n",
    "# 假设我们的出口是 105\n",
    "outlet_id = 105\n",
    "\n",
    "# 调用 BFS 函数追溯上游\n",
    "upstream_ids = bfs_upstream(G, outlet_id)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"从河段 {outlet_id} 追溯到的所有上游河段: {upstream_ids}\")\n",
    "print(f\"总共 {len(upstream_ids)} 个河段（包括出口本身）\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.2 手动模拟 BFS 过程\n",
    "\n",
    "让我们一步一步看 BFS 是如何工作的："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def bfs_upstream_visualized(G, outlet):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    带可视化输出的 BFS 追溯\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    visited = set([outlet])\n",
    "    queue = deque([outlet])\n",
    "    step = 0\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(f\"初始状态:\")\n",
    "    print(f\"  visited = {visited}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"  queue   = {list(queue)}\")\n",
    "    print()\n",
    "    \n",
    "    while queue:\n",
    "        step += 1\n",
    "        current = queue.popleft()\n",
    "        upstreams = G.get(current, set())\n",
    "        \n",
    "        print(f\"步骤 {step}: 处理河段 {current}\")\n",
    "        print(f\"  该河段的上游: {upstreams}\")\n",
    "        \n",
    "        for upstream in upstreams:\n",
    "            if upstream not in visited:\n",
    "                visited.add(upstream)\n",
    "                queue.append(upstream)\n",
    "                print(f\"  → 发现新上游 {upstream}，加入队列\")\n",
    "        \n",
    "        print(f\"  当前 visited = {visited}\")\n",
    "        print(f\"  当前 queue   = {list(queue)}\")\n",
    "        print()\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(f\"✓ 搜索完成！共找到 {len(visited)} 个河段\")\n",
    "    return visited\n",
    "\n",
    "# 运行可视化 BFS\n",
    "result = bfs_upstream_visualized(G, 105)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 💡 思考题\n",
    "\n",
    "**为什么不用 DFS (深度优先搜索)？**\n",
    "\n",
    "- BFS 是一层一层往上找，更符合我们要提取"整个面"的直觉\n",
    "- BFS 用队列实现，而 DFS 用递归，在 Python 中 BFS 通常更省内存\n",
    "- BFS 方便我们添加"只追溯前 N 层"这样的限制"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 第四步：拼图游戏与"气球技巧" (计算几何)\n",
    "\n",
    "找到了上游的所有河段 ID 后，我们需要把对应的**单元流域**（每个河段控制的小区域）拼成一个大流域。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4.1 问题：拼图之间有缝隙！\n",
    "\n",
    "由于计算机中浮点数的精度问题，这些拼图之间往往有肉眼看不见的**微小缝隙**。\n",
    "\n",
    "如果直接合并，结果会有很多小窟窿！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 演示缝隙问题\n",
    "from shapely.ops import unary_union\n",
    "\n",
    "# 创建两个中间有微小缝隙的正方形\n",
    "p1 = Polygon([(0, 0), (1, 0), (1, 1), (0, 1)])\n",
    "p2 = Polygon([(1.005, 0), (2.005, 0), (2.005, 1), (1.005, 1)])  # 0.005 的缝隙\n",
    "\n",
    "# 直接合并\n",
    "bad_union = unary_union([p1, p2])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"直接合并的结果类型: {bad_union.geom_type}\")\n",
    "print(f\"这是单个连通的多边形吗? {bad_union.geom_type == 'Polygon'}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 可视化\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(12, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "# 左图：原始数据\n",
    "ax1 = axes[0]\n",
    "for p in [p1, p2]:\n",
    "    x, y = p.exterior.xy\n",
    "    ax1.fill(x, y, alpha=0.5)\n",
    "    ax1.plot(x, y, 'k-', linewidth=1)\n",
    "ax1.set_title('原始数据（有微小缝隙）', fontsize=12)\n",
    "ax1.set_aspect('equal')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 右图：合并结果\n",
    "ax2 = axes[1]\n",
    "if bad_union.geom_type == 'MultiPolygon':\n",
    "    for geom in bad_union.geoms:\n",
    "        x, y = geom.exterior.xy\n",
    "        ax2.fill(x, y, alpha=0.5)\n",
    "        ax2.plot(x, y, 'k-', linewidth=1)\n",
    "    ax2.set_title('合并结果：MultiPolygon（有缝隙！）', fontsize=12, color='red')\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    x, y = bad_union.exterior.xy\n",
    "    ax2.fill(x, y, alpha=0.5)\n",
    "    ax2.plot(x, y, 'k-', linewidth=1)\n",
    "    ax2.set_title('合并结果：Polygon（连通的）', fontsize=12, color='green')\n",
    "ax2.set_aspect('equal')\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.2 解决方案：Buffer Trick (缓冲技巧)\n",
    "\n",
    "我们的工具库使用了一个天才般的技巧：\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **膨胀 (+buffer)**: 把所有拼图稍微吹大一点点，缝隙就被挤满了\n",
    "2. **收缩 (-buffer)**: 再把拼图缩回原来的大小\n",
    "\n",
    "就像气球一样！🎈"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def buffer_trick(geometries, epsilon=0.01):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    使用 buffer trick 修复拓扑缝隙\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    # 先合并\n",
    "    merged = unary_union(geometries)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 膨胀 -> 收缩\n",
    "    fixed = merged.buffer(epsilon).buffer(-epsilon)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return fixed\n",
    "\n",
    "# 应用 buffer trick\n",
    "good_union = buffer_trick([p1, p2], epsilon=0.01)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"修复后的结果类型: {good_union.geom_type}\")\n",
    "print(f\"这是单个连通的多边形吗? {good_union.geom_type == 'Polygon'}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 可视化对比\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 3, figsize=(15, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "# 原始\n",
    "ax1 = axes[0]\n",
    "for p in [p1, p2]:\n",
    "    x, y = p.exterior.xy\n",
    "    ax1.fill(x, y, alpha=0.5)\n",
    "ax1.set_title('原始数据', fontsize=12)\n",
    "ax1.set_aspect('equal')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 膨胀阶段\n",
    "ax2 = axes[1]\n",
    "inflated = unary_union([p1, p2]).buffer(0.01)\n",
    "x, y = inflated.exterior.xy\n",
    "ax2.fill(x, y, alpha=0.5, color='orange')\n",
    "ax2.set_title('膨胀后（缝隙被填充）', fontsize=12)\n",
    "ax2.set_aspect('equal')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 最终结果\n",
    "ax3 = axes[2]\n",
    "x, y = good_union.exterior.xy\n",
    "ax3.fill(x, y, alpha=0.5, color='green')\n",
    "ax3.set_title('收缩后（修复完成！）', fontsize=12, color='green')\n",
    "ax3.set_aspect('equal')\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.3 使用代码库的鲁棒合并函数\n",
    "\n",
    "代码库中的 `merge_catchments_fixed_robust` 不仅做了膨胀收缩，还聪明地过滤掉了真正的湖泊和错误的噪点！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 创建一组模拟的单元流域\n",
    "unit_catchments = [\n",
    "    Polygon([(0, 0), (1, 0), (1, 1), (0, 1)]),\n",
    "    Polygon([(1.001, 0), (2.001, 0), (2.001, 1), (1.001, 1)]),  # 有缝隙\n",
    "    Polygon([(2.002, 0), (3.002, 0), (3.002, 1), (2.002, 1)]),  # 有缝隙\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "# 使用我们的鲁棒合并函数\n",
    "merged_watershed = merge_catchments_fixed_robust(unit_catchments)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\n合并后的几何类型: {merged_watershed.geom_type}\")\n",
    "print(f\"合并后的面积: {merged_watershed.area:.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"原始面积之和: {sum(p.area for p in unit_catchments):.4f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 🏆 总结\n",
    "\n",
    "恭喜你！你刚刚学会了现代 GIS 水文分析的核心算法：\n",
    "\n",
    "| 步骤 | 技术 | 作用 |\n",
    "|------|------|------|\n",
    "| 1. 河网建模 | **图论** | 把河流看作节点和边 |\n",
    "| 2. 河段捕捉 | **空间索引 (R-Tree)** | 快速找到最近的河段 |\n",
    "| 3. 上游追溯 | **BFS 广度优先搜索** | 系统地找到所有上游 |\n",
    "| 4. 流域合并 | **Buffer Trick** | 修复拓扑缝隙 |\n",
    "\n",
    "这就是 `merit-catchment-extract` 工具的核心原理！🚀"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 📚 延伸阅读\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **图论基础**: [《算法导论》第22章](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Introduction_to_Algorithms)\n",
